    method  Login method, for example oauth or api-key

  FLAGS
    --auth-method <oauth|api-key>    Choose a login method
    --email, --email-hint <address>  Pre-fill login email
    --name <label>                   Label the credential, for example --name
                                     work-account

  GLOBAL FLAGS
    See minimal-agent --help for all global flags.
    -h, --help   Show help
    -d, --debug  Enable debug logging
"
`;

